    // The function maintains the invariant that max_value is always the largest number seen so far,
    // and min_value is always the smallest number seen so far.
    // The loop decreases the length of the array as it processes each element.
    // The function is total, meaning it will terminate for all valid inputs.

    // Requires: arr.len() >= 0
    // Ensures: if arr.is_empty() then result == (None, None)
